    "page_content": "authority matrix.\n7. Exceptions and Escalation\nDeviations from this policy require Finance Manager approval, with escalation to Group Finance for exceptions\nexceeding $100,000 in order value.\n8. Related Policies\n- POL-ORD-002: Order Intake Value & SSP Allocation Policy\n- POL-ORD-003: Order Intake Approval & Backlog Management Policy\n9. Revision History\nCFO POLICY FRAMEWORK | POL-ORD-001 Page 3",
